                                <h2 style="color:#7b412b; font-weight: bold; font-size:14px" >1. Achievement</h2>
                             </tr>
                             <ul style="color:#333; padding-left: 2.2%;">
								<li>During 2020-21, the turnover of the Company was Rs.1760.84 crore as against Rs. 803.17 crore during FY 2019-20 registering an increase of 119%.The Profit After Tax from continuing & discontinuing operation during FY 2020-21 was Rs 109.98 crore.</li>

<li>Total copper metal sales of the company was 32,997 tonne in 2020-21.</li>

<li>Market capitalisation of the company reached around Rs.11,000 Crore as on 31st March 2021 from Rs. 2,000 Crore as on 31st March 2020.</li>

<li>HCL procured 41.12% of total procurement from MSME vendors in FY 2020-21 against the mandatory target of 25%.</li>

<li>Power Purchase agreement (PPA) has been signed with party for installation of 4.5 MWp solar plant at MCP. </li>

<li>The Malanjkhand underground mining project has achieved one important milestone i.einterconnection of north and south decline at 240 MRL. This has created readiness for taking out ore production through decline from underground mines.</li>

<li>HCL has signed a long-termsale agreement with a domestic primary copper producer for sale of around 60% of its total quantity of annual copper concentrate production. </li>
                               
                              </ul>
